{
  "id": "hardened",
  "name": "Hardened",
  "order": 3,
  "tagline": "Maximum security, still anti-cheat compatible",
  "description": "Balanced plus encrypted DNS (Quad9), AI features off, Office/Adobe ASR rules in Block mode (instead of Audit), Controlled Folder Access in Audit mode, UAC always notify, NetBIOS off, Remote Desktop/Assistance off, PowerShell script block logging and the unused Wi-Fi adapter off. VBS, HVCI, TPM and Secure Boot stay exactly as competitive anti-cheat requires.",
